    title: "Mahalaxmi Estate | Premium Flats in Nagpur",
    description: "Trusted real estate developer in Nagpur. 2 & 3 BHK luxury flats. Book now at ₹51,000.",
    type: "website",
    url: "https://mahalaxmiestate.com",
